svx: chart look helpers a kit client can drive

ChartHelper gains IsChartLook, SetChartLook and WriteChartLook (type,
titles, legend, as JSON), moved here from Calc so Impress can use them.
The JSON keeps its types (boost.json): a field of the wrong type, such
as a legend that is not true or false or a title that is not text, is
refused before anything changes.
A scatter starts as points only when the chart becomes one; a scatter
kept as one keeps its lines.

